@startuml
' Figure 33.4  Tool and description poisoning
' Reading order: top to bottom. A supplier submits a description that
' asks for the booking record; review rejects it. Later an approved
' tool changes its text; the gateway hash no longer matches and the
' call is refused. From threats.battery (P01, P03).
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Supplier" as S <<ops>>
participant "Gateway" as G <<policy>>
participant "Agent" as H <<model>>
S -> G : Submit text
G -[$FAIL]> S : Rejected
S -> S : Change text
H -> G : Call tool
G -> G : Hash differs
G -[$FAIL]> H : Refused
@enduml
